268474]},"d":{"dates":["2026-10-24","2026-11-25"],"peak":[435,282],"avg":[435,248.48571428571432],"cnt":[1,5]},"desc":"Welcome to Subterra ⛏️! \nIt's a 2.5 dimensional mining game with a procedurally generated world where you dig deeper, upgrade your pickaxe and survive layers that get more hostile the further you descend.\n\n❓ [ How to Play ]\n- Mine ores and upgrade your pickaxe to go even deeper.\n- Build your character with Ability Cards.\n- Craft Weapons that help you defeat monsters.\n- Obtain rare recipes of weapons and potions.\n- Explore various layers.\n- Defeat Monsters and Bosses!\n\n💻 [ Controls ]\n- E to open Inventory\n- C to Interact\n- F to Block/Parry\n- Left Mouse to Mine\n\n💾 [BETA] \nThe game is still under development, expect various changes. \nIf you find bugs or have suggestions let us know in the community server!\n\nThank you for playing!","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a4703fe7fb3f75427ac5a8348088b4b2/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f34dfe829d1a4b3f6113f02504d5179d/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1fff9da7a582d1befd4957a18ec14a48/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}